  "description": "Default theme. Components resolve assets by semantic slot, never by filename. Future themes (magic-academy / space / forest) ship the same slot keys with their own files. `*Display` keys are display-size copies (mascots 512px, avatar 192px) derived from the unchanged masters; Domain icons use the slot `domain.<domain_id>` for all eight training domains; `domain.*Png` are 192px PNG renditions of the domain SVG masters for clients without SVG (the Mini Program). A domain with no file here gets its interface glyph in the same tile. `domain.squares` has no file: the v0.3 picture (domains/domain-squares.svg / -192.png) is a cube, and 平方 must not use a cube (docs/ux/05_specialist_grouped_grid.md §5). The masters stay the source of truth.",
